<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanqishu" book-id="b-nanqishu-027" chapter-id="c-nanqishu-027-wangbi-huaizhen" source-id="s-nanqishu-027-wangbi-huaizhen-ws1508012">
  <p id="c-nanqishu-027-wangbi-huaizhen:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanqishu-027-wangbi-huaizhen:p001:m0000" ref="w3a_mm0_hw1_*A">劉懷珍</persName>字<persName id="c-nanqishu-027-wangbi-huaizhen:p001:m0004" ref="w3a_mm0_hw1_*A">道玉</persName>，平原人，漢膠東康王後也。祖<persName id="c-nanqishu-027-wangbi-huaizhen:p001:m0020" ref="w3a_mm0_hw1">昶</persName>，宋武帝平齊，以為青州治中，至員外常侍。</p>
  <p id="c-nanqishu-027-wangbi-huaizhen:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">竟陵王<persName id="c-nanqishu-027-wangbi-huaizhen:p002:m0003" ref="9d4_1cb_fb9">誕</persName>反，郡豪民<persName id="c-nanqishu-027-wangbi-huaizhen:p002:m0009" ref="4ph_h3g_sr0">王弼</persName>勸<persName id="c-nanqishu-027-wangbi-huaizhen:p002:m0012" ref="w3a_mm0_hw1_*A">懷珍</persName>應之，<persName id="c-nanqishu-027-wangbi-huaizhen:p002:m0017" ref="w3a_mm0_hw1_*A">懷珍</persName>斬<persName id="c-nanqishu-027-wangbi-huaizhen:p002:m0020" ref="4ph_h3g_sr0">弼</persName>以聞。</p>
</text>
